model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "App Settings starts its groups read before the app access gate. Shared-account Manage access starts access and groups before the account detail gate. Public desktop and phone guards require group dispatch while those earlier reads remain held, then prove that the released form reuses that response while later groups reads are held. Existing sharing authority, drafts, failure and retry behavior remain authoritative. The early-read helpers subscribe on the page that owns the access dialog or Settings view; the eventual form still resolves its current access and handles failed reads normally."
    }
  }
}
